<title>USA: TABLE - Kinnard Investments Inc Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Kinnard Investments Inc Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				  Three months ended Six months ended</p>
<p>				   6/30/97  6/30/96  6/30/97  6/30/96</p>
<p> Revenues			   $12,898 $30,932 $24,071 $53,093</p>
<p> Operating expenses		11,715  25,497  23,403  45,436</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes   1,183   5,435     668   7,657</p>
<p> Income tax expense		   482   2,175     282   3,068</p>
<p> Net income			     701   3,260     386   4,589</p>
<p> Primary earnings per share	0.11    0.54    0.06    0.75</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding     6,364   6,038   6,236   6,108</p>
<p>						   6/30/97    12/31/96</p>
<p>Book value per common share</p>
<p>     outstanding			     $5.99	 $5.98</p>
<p>NOTE: '96 Q2 earnings include results of PRIMEVEST Financial Services, Inc., which was sold by Kinnard in October 1996. If the results of PRIMEVEST were excluded from the prior year, net income for the second quarter of 1996 would have been $2.8 million, or 46 cents per share, on revenues of $22.3 million, the company said.</p>
<p>		 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
